Third-party material in this crate
----------------------------------

`vendor/llama.cpp/ggml.h` is vendored unmodified from llama.cpp, and
`src/llama_abi.h` transcribes, field for field, the parts of llama.cpp's
`include/llama.h` the probe uses. Nothing from llama.cpp is linked: the probe
loads the pinned llama.dll at run time.

